1
00:00:02,495 --> 00:00:04,125
As Uke comes to grab the wrist

2
00:00:04,126 --> 00:00:05,685
move off center slightly

3
00:00:05,686 --> 00:00:07,579
drawing his weight down to your center

4
00:00:07,580 --> 00:00:09,738
holding his wrist with the opposite hand

5
00:00:10,039 --> 00:00:11,308
step in deeply,

6
00:00:11,809 --> 00:00:14,843
turn your body sharply, and cut down

7
00:00:14,844 --> 00:00:18,310
placing Uke directly in front of you

